cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "CGV: Comparative Gene Viewer"
message: "If you use CGV in your research, please cite the software using this metadata and the archived release DOI once available."
type: software
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-07-24
license: MIT
url: "https://cgvapp.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/raulrojas22/CGV"
abstract: >-
  CGV (Comparative Gene Viewer) is an interactive R/Shiny web application for
  comparative gene visualization and functional analysis across species. It
  combines local indexed genomes, annotations, and Gene Ontology resources with
  live public API queries to support homologous and orthologous exploration,
  structural comparison, analytics, sequence extraction, and functional context
  in a single web interface.
keywords:
  - comparative genomics
  - gene visualization
  - shiny
  - gene ontology
  - bioinformatics
